, "avatar": "bbc24475f0c5dc70f7baa429aac1e282fd806f2b"}, "language": "english", "review": "(EDIT 11-Dec-25)\nNew information for review:\nCrossplay is only available between Xbox and PC Gamepass.\nSteam has no crossplay in it.\n\nThis is bad for me, no crossplay at all then, so that's not adding any positivity to my review, Sorry.\nI'll change this to Positive when we have crossplay between Steam (Steam Machine in 2026!) and Xbox, without the use of Gamepass or paid multiplayer subcsriptions. Then we're golden!\n\nOld review part:\nUnoptimized garbage. I'm still playing it, because otherwise it's fun. The game works alright, with slight stuttering constantly throughout the levels, but that's fine. There isn't 3 minutes of the game running with smooth FPS in a straight row. It will stutter on every single level.\n\nUntil finally you reach exploration level 2-13 and 2-14 and 2-16 bossfight. Prepare for 5 FPS and dying constantly due to technical issues at any graphics settings.\n\nThe 50 enemies that spam with flamethrowers tank the frame rate to below 5 and you'll experience your first Down. Thanks developers for your bad programming.\nChanging settings won't change anything. You just have to get lucky to get past that mission.\n\nFlamethrower = bugged.\nAnything related to flames = bugged.\n\nDevs, fix that asap or many people will quit at 2-13 exploration, because it's unfairly unplayable. Also pre-emptively fix every other future level that utilizes flamethrower weapons on enemies.", "timestamp_created": 1765125209, "timestamp_updated": 1765447665, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.46875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212787121", "author": {"steamid": "76561199167228835", "personaname": "SIlas Chester", "persona_status"